Go straight ahead that way and you'll find it.
Go to the third intersection.
Go straight ahead a little beyond the second traffic light.
You'll find a bookstore ahead. Turn right there.
Turn to the left at the corner over there, and you'll see it.
It's that way next to the police station.
It's over there behind the hospital.
It's in front of the main gate of that school.
It's in that building over there.
See that tall yellow building over there? It is there at that building.
Go through under the railroad ahead and turn right along the train tracks.
Then, you'll come to a shopping street. If you follow the street you'll get to the station.
